msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh... Kiryu-san. Don't tell me... you saw all that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Heh... Screwed it up again. Tokyo's a pretty tough place\r\n"
"to live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I'd say. Tokyo's got its own set of rules."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I've gotta start the job search again... If I don't work,\r\n"
"I won't be able to pay that Tokyo rent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"See you later, then! I'm gonna see if I can find a job\r\n"
"around here. I'll text you if something works out."
msgstr ""

